@startuml AnalytiCore_Sequence_Diagram
title AnalytiCore Note App - Main System Sequence Diagram

actor "User" as User

participant "React SPA" as UI
participant "Auth API Client" as AuthClient
participant "Document Ingestion" as Ingestion
participant "Document Storage" as Storage
participant "Express API" as API
database "MySQL 8.4" as MySQL
participant "Agent Chatbox" as Chat
participant "NLU / Agent Tools" as Agent
participant "Ollama / Llama 3" as Ollama
participant "External REST API" as ExternalAPI

== Application Startup and Authentication ==

User -> UI : Open application
UI -> AuthClient : fetchAuthStatus()
AuthClient -> API : GET /api/auth/status
API -> MySQL : Validate session and user
MySQL --> API : Session and account status
API --> AuthClient : hasUsers, UserAccount or null
AuthClient --> UI : Authentication status

alt No user accounts
  User -> UI : Submit initial administrator details
  UI -> AuthClient : setupInitialAdmin(payload)
  AuthClient -> API : POST /api/auth/setup
  API -> MySQL : Hash password and create admin
  MySQL --> API : Administrator created
  API --> AuthClient : HttpOnly session cookie
else Existing account
  User -> UI : Enter credentials
  UI -> AuthClient : loginUser(identifier, password)
  AuthClient -> API : POST /api/auth/login
  API -> MySQL : Verify account and password
  MySQL --> API : Active user or authentication error
  API --> AuthClient : UserAccount and session cookie
end

UI --> User : Show role-appropriate workspace

== Load Stored Documents ==

UI -> Storage : loadStoredDocuments()
Storage -> API : GET /api/documents
API -> MySQL : SELECT documents and text chunks
MySQL --> API : Stored document records
API --> Storage : Document metadata and content
Storage --> UI : KnowledgeDocument[]

== Upload and Persist a Document ==

User -> UI : Select and upload PDF, CSV, TXT, PNG or JPG
UI -> Ingestion : isSupportedDocument(file)

alt Unsupported or too large
  Ingestion --> UI : Validation error
  UI --> User : Display upload error
else Valid document
  Ingestion -> Ingestion : extractDocumentText(file)

  alt Text extraction fails
    Ingestion --> UI : Extraction error
  else Text extracted
    Ingestion --> UI : Extracted content and token count
  end

  UI -> Storage : saveStoredDocument(document)
  Storage -> API : POST /api/documents\nMultipart file and metadata
  API -> API : Verify Admin or Writer role\nCalculate SHA-256 checksum
  API -> MySQL : INSERT or update document
  API -> MySQL : Replace document text chunks
  MySQL --> API : Persistence result
  API --> Storage : 201 Created
  Storage --> UI : Updated document
  UI --> User : Document ready or error status
end

== Dashboard Analytics ==

User -> UI : Open Dashboard and Analytics
UI -> UI : getStructuredDatasets(documents)
UI -> UI : Calculate retail metrics
UI -> UI : Run K-means clustering
UI -> UI : Run linear regression
UI -> UI : Generate product price forecast
UI --> User : Display charts and analytics

== Agentic AI Question ==

User -> Chat : Enter analytical question
Chat -> Chat : Append user message
Chat -> Agent : classifyNaturalLanguageIntent(query)
Agent --> Chat : Intent plan

Chat -> Chat : buildGlobalKnowledgeContext(documents)
Chat -> Storage : loadApiEndpoints()

Chat -> API : POST /api/external-api
API -> ExternalAPI : Fetch configured endpoint
ExternalAPI --> API : JSON or text response
API --> Chat : External API context

Chat -> Ollama : ollama.chat(model, context, tools, options)
Ollama --> Chat : Tool-call request or final answer

loop Up to five agent steps
  alt Native tool call requested
    Chat -> Agent : executeAgentTool(name, arguments)
    Agent -> Ingestion : Retrieve document content
    Ingestion --> Agent : Relevant chunks
    Agent -> Agent : Run analytics or create artifact
    Agent --> Chat : Tool output
    Chat -> Ollama : Send tool output for synthesis
    Ollama --> Chat : Next tool call or final answer
  else No tool call
    Chat --> Chat : finalAnswer = response.content
  end
end

alt Ollama unavailable or tools unsupported
  Chat -> Chat : Run deterministic fallback logic
  Chat --> User : Display fallback or connectivity error
else Successful response
  Chat --> User : Display answer and downloadable artifacts
end

== Profile and User Management ==

User -> UI : Update profile or password
UI -> AuthClient : updateProfile / changePassword
AuthClient -> API : PUT /api/profile or /api/profile/password
API -> MySQL : Update profile or password hash
MySQL --> API : Updated account
API --> AuthClient : Updated UserAccount
AuthClient --> UI : Refresh current user

alt Administrator
  User -> UI : Create or manage users
  UI -> AuthClient : create/update/delete user
  AuthClient -> API : POST/PUT/DELETE /api/users
  API -> API : Require administrator role
  API -> MySQL : Apply user change
  MySQL --> API : Result
  API --> AuthClient : Updated user list or account
  AuthClient --> UI : Refresh user management view
end

== Sign Out ==

User -> UI : Sign out
UI -> AuthClient : logoutUser()
AuthClient -> API : POST /api/auth/logout
API -> MySQL : Delete session record
API --> AuthClient : Clear HttpOnly session cookie
AuthClient --> UI : Session cleared
UI --> User : Return to login page

@enduml